# %% [markdown]
# ## Loop:
#
# **Observe**:
# - run tests
#
# **Select**:
# - parse failures
# - pick one failing test (or pick the first one)
#
#  **Act**:
# - read the relevant file
# - apply the smallest change to fix that failure
#
#  **Verify**:
# - run tests again
# - mark failure resolved or not
#
#  **Terminate**:
# - all tests pass or
# - max iterations reached

