Usage (from this directory, with deps installed):
  export OPENROUTER_API_KEY=...
  export OPENROUTER_MODEL=openai/gpt-4o-mini   # optional
  export REPO_ONBOARDING_ROOT=/path/to/repo   # optional; defaults to course repo root
